WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.512
Evaluation should match the task.

00:00:02.512 --> 00:00:08.992
Classification may use accuracy or F1, extraction can compare fields, summaries may need human review,

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:17.402
and rag answers need faithfulness and citation checks in addition to answer quality.

00:00:17.402 --> 00:00:21.957
No single metric describes every L L M application.

00:00:21.957 --> 00:00:29.480
The metric should reflect what failure actually matters to the application, not simply what is easiest to calculate.
